  "color": {
    "$description": "Primitive color scale. 25 steps per hue (0–1000). Step N has L = N/1000 in OKLCH — perceptually uniform across all hues at the same step. Chroma (C) tapers at extremes to stay within sRGB gamut. Hex values are approximate sRGB-gamut-mapped fallbacks; verify with culori or oklch.com before production. OKLCH values are authoritative. Do not use these directly in components — reference semantic tokens instead.",
